      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The provisions our sisters nearly died to deliver-\r\nwas all stolen by those damn \r\ngoblin family bastards!",
        "Jp" : "姐さんたちに命がけで運んでもらった食料が――\r\nゴブリン一家のやつらに\r\n根こそぎ盗まれちまったんでさ！"
