      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Under normal circumstances I'd catch them all \r\nwithout exception...\r\nBut, as you can see, \r\nI injured my leg the other day―",
        "Jp" : "普段ならこの俺が\r\n一匹たりとも逃さず捕まえるとこですが\r\nこの通り、先日の足のケガで――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675707,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 23,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Just one slow-footed critter—\r\nWas that too much to ask for?",
