      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 24,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Quite the distinctive little thief.\r\nDropped its entire haul mid-flight,\r\nand yet... it slipped through my fingers.",
        "Jp" : "そいつだけ他と違う見た目で目立つし\r\n何より盗んだ食料全部落として行っちまうほどで\r\n――まぁ、そいつにも逃げられちまいましたが"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675710,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 25,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Judging from the direction they fled―\r\nthey must have gone to the ruins\r\nthat serve as their hideout.",
